    "updated_at": "2023-01-20T08:19:29Z",
    "body": "I am pretty sure after skimming the relevant parts of the spec that the `error` property should be populated. So I think this is just a browser bug, that you should file on the browser bug trackers.\r\n\r\nOr, did you find a part of the spec that distinguishes the source vs. src=\"\" cases?",
