    "updated_at": "2024-10-09T09:22:00Z",
    "body": "If information about the source load failure were exposed on the media element then information would be limited to a single source.  If the information is important, then it is presumably important for all sources that fail their load, and so would preferably be on the source element or on the \"error\" `Event`s fired on those source elements.",
